      176.13,
      203.45,
      387.56,
      214.79
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE HUMAN RIGHTS ORGANIZATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.77,
      401.91,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Organization called and known as the \u201cHumanRights Organization\u201d has heretofore been formed in No. 10,Mosque Lane, Galle Road, Colombo 3 for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Organization according to the rulesagreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      317.69,
      401.9,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.89,
      401.9,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      431.93,
      401.88,
      455.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Human RightsOrganization (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      470.09,
      401.93,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many person as now are members of the HumanRights Organization (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cOrganization\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate,with perpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cHuman Rights Organization\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued, with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal and to alterthe same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.77,
      401.87,
      633.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.57,
      647.93,
      401.86,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(a) to protect and make known human rights, humanitiesand fundamental rights ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      431.35,
      443.86,
      440.42
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
