    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      202.97,
      397.17,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) to promote and encourage humanities, sports andsocial services ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.71,
      238.97,
      397.17,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) to facilitate in providing various relief facilities tothose affected by the natural disasters and man madedisasters ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      286.97,
      397.19,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "(d) to conduct seminars, dialog and various programmesof religious, social and cultural important locally andinternationally ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.71,
      334.97,
      333.45,
      346.31
    ],
    "text": "(e) to organise leadership programmes ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      358.97,
      397.17,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "(f) to provide various support services to lower incomeand poor people ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      394.97,
      397.18,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(g) to lead a committee of patrons comprising of religiousleaders representing all communities ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.87,
      426.89,
      397.2,
      486.23
    ],
    "text": "(h) to establish and conduct libraries, to assist in printingand publishing of books, magazines, souvenirs,journals, cassettes, compact Disks and software andto provide other services necessary to the attainmentof the objectives of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      494.93,
      397.19,
      530.27
    ],
    "text": "(i) to do acts in collaboration with institutions ororganizations local or foreign, having similar objectsto those of the Corporation ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.15,
      538.97,
      397.18,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "(j) to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidental or conducive to the attainment ofthe above objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      584.45,
      397.18,
      667.79
    ],
    "text": "4. (1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall, subject to the provision of this Actand the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,vested in a Board of Directors (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cBoard\u201d) consisting of the office bearers and such otherpersons as may be provided for in such rules and elected inaccordance therewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
