  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.87,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of the Foundation holding office onthe day preceding the date of commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.89,
      401.9,
      390.23
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provision of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever as are necessary or desirable for thefurtherance of its objects or any one of them, includingthe power to open, operate and close bank accounts, toborrow or raise moneys with or without security, toreceive or collect grants or donations, to invest its funds, toerect any building or structure on any land held by theCorporation, and to engage, employ and dismiss officersand servants required for the carrying out of the objects ofthe Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      398.93,
      401.89,
      458.27
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime at any general meeting and by the votes of not less thantwo thirds of the members present and voting, to make rules,not inconsistent with the provision of this Act or any otherwritten law, for all or any of the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      176.61,
      466.97,
      401.88,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)the classification of membership,fees payable byeach calss of members and admission, withdrawal,expulsion or resignation of members and for themaintaining of register of members ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      176.61,
      522.89,
      401.86,
      558.23
    ],
    "text": "(b)the election of office bearers of the Board orvacation of or removal from, office and the powers,duties and functions of the office bearers ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.33,
      566.93,
      401.88,
      602.27
    ],
    "text": "(c)the appointment, powers, duties and functions andconditions of the various officers, agents andservants of the Corporation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
